WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:32.333
In the earlier verses of Chapter 14,

2
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.333
Lord Krishna described the binding effects

3
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.625
of sattva, rajas,

4
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:40.500
and tamas separately.

5
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.208
Now in verse 14.9,

6
00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.000
He presents the essence –

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.333
how each guna

8
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.791
binds the jivatma.

9
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:53.083
Sattva Guna keeps the jivatma in
the bondage of happiness.

10
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:56.833
Rajo Guna binds it to constant action.

11
00:00:56.833 --> 00:01:02.333
Tamo Guna binds it in laziness, error,
and delusion.

12
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.541
A person under sattva Guna

13
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:11.041
becomes attached to the happiness

14
00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:12.666
that comes from knowledge

15
00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:15.000
and moral refinement.

16
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.958
This bondage keeps them away from sin,

17
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:19.541
but subtle pride

18
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:23.833
stops the soul’s true progress.

19
00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.583
Under Rajo Guna, a person becomes bound

20
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.250
to action and its fruits.

21
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:32.083
The constant pursuit of wealth,

22
00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:36.000
respect, or success keeps them entangled
in the cycle of karma.

23
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.375
Under Tamo Guna, knowledge becomes covered

24
00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:42.333
and the jivatma is bound by carelessness
and error.

25
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:45.375
Such people, not understanding their
own condition,

26
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.500
engage in harmful behaviour

27
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.666
that causes suffering to both themselves
and others.

28
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:55.416
Although the experiences of these three gunas

29
00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:57.416
appear different –

30
00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:59.000
happiness, effort,

31
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.416
or delusion – the result is the same for all:

32
00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:06.708
the soul remains bound in the world.

33
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:10.083
True elevation is possible only when the jivatma

34
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:13.250
rises above the influence of all these gunas –

35
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:16.375
through spiritual knowledge and devotion.

36
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.625
Sometimes,

37
00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:25.875
without any particular reason,

38
00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.500
you feel the mind is heavy.

39
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.958
You wake up and want to go back to sleep.

40
00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:32.750
You postpone tasks,

41
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.708
scroll through your phone without purpose,

42
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:39.875
and before you know it, half the day is gone.

43
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:41.583
You tell yourself –

44
00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.375
‘I just need some rest’

45
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:45.875
or ‘I’ll do it later.’

46
00:02:45.875 --> 00:02:49.750
But this may not be tiredness alone –

47
00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:55.208
perhaps Tamo Guna is slowly taking over.

48
00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:58.875
It does not always come in a big way.

49
00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:02.166
Sometimes it comes as boredom.

50
00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:04.958
Or as a tendency to do nothing.

51
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:07.666
And if you let it stay,

52
00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:10.666
it affects not only your life

53
00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:15.291
but the energy within you too.

54
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:17.916
If everyone were to live this way,

55
00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:22.000
think about what that environment’s
energy would feel like –

56
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.583
slow, confused, and directionless.

57
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:27.750
But remember –

58
00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.750
you are the soul.

59
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:30.833
You are full of energy,

60
00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:34.208
clarity, and purpose.

61
00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:35.833
Do not let the fog of laziness

62
00:03:35.833 --> 00:03:39.708
spread over your days.

63
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:42.166
Begin with resolve.

64
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:43.541
Set a small goal

65
00:03:43.541 --> 00:03:46.791
each day and fulfil it.

66
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:50.750
Add a spiritual practice.

67
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.583
Gradually the energy will begin to shift.

68
00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:56.958
Real change happens this way –

69
00:03:56.958 --> 00:03:59.208
by understanding the right things

70
00:03:59.208 --> 00:04:02.000
and putting them into action.

71
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Starting from one small improvement
and gradually bringing every

72
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.375
area of life into alignment.

73
00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:11.208
Each step taken

74
00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:15.000
in the right direction matters.

75
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.458
It slowly frees you from the influence

76
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.000
of these gunas.

77
00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:27.250
In every family

78
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.583
you can see a particular mindset

79
00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:31.916
or culture.

80
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:33.125
Some families

81
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:37.000
are calm, clean, and orderly –

82
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:42.208
they value knowledge, discipline,
and good conduct.

83
00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:44.916
This is the influence of sattva Guna.

84
00:04:44.916 --> 00:04:47.791
Some others are always busy –

85
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:50.083
in events, in the race for achievements,

86
00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:52.583
in constant planning.

87
00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:55.541
This is the mark of Rajo Guna.

88
00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.083
And in some families,

89
00:04:58.083 --> 00:05:02.500
postponement, confusion, and
laziness dominate.

90
00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:06.375
People sleep more, forget responsibilities,

91
00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:10.291
and react instead of thinking.

92
00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:13.208
This is

93
00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:14.958
the effect of Tamo Guna.

94
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:16.958
You forget

95
00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:20.708
that these gunas are not only personal habits –

96
00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:21.666
they also

97
00:05:21.666 --> 00:05:25.625
shape the family’s collective energy.

98
00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:29.083
You think, ‘this is just how we are.’

99
00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:32.208
But this too is bondage,

100
00:05:32.208 --> 00:05:35.041
even if it feels normal.

101
00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:38.958
So I say to you – reflect.

102
00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:41.333
What kind of atmosphere

103
00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.833
are you creating

104
00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:46.958
in your home?

105
00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:48.458
Is your family

106
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:51.166
caught in the bondage of these gunas?

107
00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:54.791
The purpose of these thoughts is not to criticise,

108
00:05:54.791 --> 00:05:56.916
only to become aware.

109
00:05:56.916 --> 00:06:00.875
Because when you recognise these gunas,

110
00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:03.250
only then does the process

111
00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.583
of rising above them begin –
and that too, together.

112
00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:15.583
You may think that knowledge

113
00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:19.625
is your greatest asset at the workplace.

114
00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:21.833
And this is true –

115
00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:25.208
when used well.

116
00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:26.916
But when that same

117
00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:30.750
knowledge begins to make you feel superior…

118
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.333
when you stop listening

119
00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:36.375
to others because ‘you already know’…

120
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:41.125
then this very strength begins to bind you.

121
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:44.458
This is the bondage of sattva Guna –

122
00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:47.875
when knowledge takes the form of ego.

123
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:51.000
On the other side is Tamo Guna.

124
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.125
It makes no noise,

125
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:56.041
it simply enters quietly –

126
00:06:56.041 --> 00:06:58.958
in the form of postponing work,
missing deadlines,

127
00:06:58.958 --> 00:07:04.833
doing things halfway, or dozing
through meetings.

128
00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:07.083
And when this becomes a habit,

129
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:10.000
the whole team is affected.

130
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.375
So what is the path?

131
00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:16.208
Stay awake.

132
00:07:16.208 --> 00:07:18.958
Make your knowledge a tool

133
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:21.291
for clarity, not for ego.

134
00:07:21.291 --> 00:07:24.375
Use your ability to lift the team,

135
00:07:24.375 --> 00:07:26.916
not to distance yourself from them.

136
00:07:26.916 --> 00:07:30.916
And when you see yourself slipping into

137
00:07:30.916 --> 00:07:34.083
sluggishness or carelessness,

138
00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:38.000
stop – and bring yourself back.

139
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:44.333
I am present within you as the Paramatma –

140
00:07:44.333 --> 00:07:47.791
when something feels misaligned,

141
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:52.083
I give you a signal, I pause you.

142
00:07:52.083 --> 00:07:56.250
Simply recognise those signals.

143
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.666
The true professional is neither caught

144
00:07:58.666 --> 00:08:02.375
in knowing the most,

145
00:08:02.375 --> 00:08:05.625
nor in being the busiest.

146
00:08:05.625 --> 00:08:08.916
They remain aware in every moment,

147
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:12.541
and every moment is purposeful.

148
00:08:12.541 --> 00:08:16.708
This is what lifts you above these gunas…

149
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:19.833
and makes life truly meaningful.
